{"path":"js/packages/host-companion/README.md","ref":"04760101d68405a97b39f799f3f4f9181fa18778","side":"old","lines":[{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":1,"text":"# VitaDeck Host Companion"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":3,"text":"The Host Companion runs on a Mac, Windows or Linux computer near your Vita. A Deck App sends it **Host Control** commands over the LAN, and the companion runs them on the computer. It is not published to npm yet; run it from a VitaDeck checkout with Node.js 24 (`pnpm --dir js install` once)."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":5,"text":"**Security:** v1 trusts the LAN. There are no credentials: a link exchanges addresses and authorizes nothing, and IP checks can be spoofed. That is why the only plugins so far read information. Plugins that act on the computer (keys, launching apps) wait for the credential decision in [ADR 0004](../../../docs/adr/0004-host-control-sliced-delivery.md)."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":6,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":7,"text":"## Use"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":8,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":9,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":10,"text":"pnpm --dir js host-companion start"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":11,"text":"```"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":12,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":13,"text":"Serves `POST /command` on every interface, port 8797. The port never moves to a free one, because the Vita stores the URL; if it is busy, `start` exits with an error. It prints its URLs, the loaded plugins, and one line per request (time, peer, `plugin.command`, result, duration). Payloads are never logged."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":14,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":15,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":16,"text":"pnpm --dir js host-companion link 192.168.1.177"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":17,"text":"```"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":18,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":19,"text":"Open Host Control in the VitaDeck Shell and pass the address it shows (add `:port` if it is not 8798). `link` checks that `start` is answering, then tells VitaDeck where to send commands. One Vita can link several computers, and one computer can link several Vitas."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":20,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":21,"text":"Options: `--port N` (both commands; use the same one for `link` if you started with it), `--plugin <specifier>` (repeatable, `start` only, in addition to the config), `--advertise <ip>` (`link` only), `--config <path>`."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":22,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":23,"text":"## Config"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":24,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":25,"text":"`~/.vitadeck/host-companion.json`, created on first use:"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":26,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":27,"text":"- `id`: generated once. VitaDeck keeps one link per id, so relinking replaces the old link."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":28,"text":"- `name`: shown on the Vita. Defaults to the hostname."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":29,"text":"- `port`: 8797."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":30,"text":"- `advertise`: the IP put in the link URL. `null` uses the interface your computer routes to the Vita, which skips VPN and Docker interfaces."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":31,"text":"- `vitas`: Vita IPs that `link` added. While it is empty, the companion answers everyone; once it is not, only those Vitas, loopback and this computer's own addresses get answers, and everyone else gets `forbidden`."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":32,"text":"- `plugins`: plugins to load next to the built-in `core` plugin. Defaults to `@vitadeck/host-plugin-system-stats`."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":33,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":34,"text":"## Plugins"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":35,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":36,"text":"A **Host Control Plugin** is a package with two exports:"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":37,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":38,"text":"- `.`: the registry a Deck App imports and passes to `createHostClient`. It is bundled into the Deck App and runs on QuickJS, so it imports only `@vitadeck/sdk/host-control`:"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":39,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":40,"text":"  ```ts"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":41,"text":"  export const lightsPlugin = defineHostPlugin(\"lights\", {"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":42,"text":"    toggle: command<{ room: string }, { on: boolean }>(isRoom),"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":43,"text":"  });"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":44,"text":"  ```"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":45,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":46,"text":"- `./companion`: the implementation, which default-exports `implementHostPlugin(registry, implementations)` from `@vitadeck/host-companion`. A missing or mistyped implementation fails `tsc`. Throw `new HostCommandError(\"unsupported_platform\", \"...\")` to answer with a specific code; any other throw answers `command_failed` with its message."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":47,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":48,"text":"Since `@vitadeck/host-companion` is not published, plugins live in this workspace under `js/host-plugins/`, with the companion as a `peerDependency`. [`system-stats`](../../host-plugins/system-stats) is the example. To load one, either add it to this package's `dependencies` and put its name in `plugins`, or give a path to its implementation file (relative to where you run the command): `--plugin ./js/host-plugins/lights/src/companion.ts`."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":49,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":50,"text":"## Run in the background"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":51,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":52,"text":"The companion has no installer or tray icon; let the OS start it at login. Replace `/path/to/vitadeck` with your checkout."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":53,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":54,"text":"**macOS:** save as `~/Library/LaunchAgents/dev.vitadeck.host-companion.plist`, then `launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/dev.vitadeck.host-companion.plist`. The login shell finds `pnpm` the same way your terminal does."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":55,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":56,"text":"```xml"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":57,"text":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":58,"text":"<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN\" \"http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":59,"text":"<plist version=\"1.0\">"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":60,"text":"<dict>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":61,"text":"  <key>Label</key><string>dev.vitadeck.host-companion</string>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":62,"text":"  <key>ProgramArguments</key>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":63,"text":"  <array>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":64,"text":"    <string>/bin/zsh</string><string>-lc</string>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":65,"text":"    <string>pnpm --dir /path/to/vitadeck/js host-companion start</string>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":66,"text":"  </array>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":67,"text":"  <key>RunAtLoad</key><true/>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":68,"text":"  <key>KeepAlive</key><true/>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":69,"text":"  <key>StandardOutPath</key><string>/tmp/vitadeck-host-companion.log</string>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":70,"text":"  <key>StandardErrorPath</key><string>/tmp/vitadeck-host-companion.log</string>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":71,"text":"</dict>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":72,"text":"</plist>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":73,"text":"```"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":74,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":75,"text":"**Windows:** create a scheduled task that starts at log on:"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":76,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":77,"text":"```bat"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":78,"text":"schtasks /Create /SC ONLOGON /TN \"VitaDeck Host Companion\" /TR \"cmd /c pnpm --dir C:\\path\\to\\vitadeck\\js host-companion start\""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":79,"text":"```"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":80,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":81,"text":"**Linux:** save as `~/.config/systemd/user/vitadeck-host-companion.service`, then `systemctl --user enable --now vitadeck-host-companion`."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":82,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":83,"text":"```ini"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":84,"text":"[Unit]"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":85,"text":"Description=VitaDeck Host Companion"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":86,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":87,"text":"[Service]"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":88,"text":"ExecStart=/bin/bash -lc \"pnpm --dir /path/to/vitadeck/js host-companion start\""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":89,"text":"Restart=on-failure"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":90,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":91,"text":"[Install]"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":92,"text":"WantedBy=default.target"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":93,"text":"```"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":94,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":95,"text":"## Firewall"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":96,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":97,"text":"The Vita connects to the companion, so the computer must accept incoming connections on the port. The first `start` triggers a prompt: on macOS, allow `node` to accept incoming network connections; on Windows, allow Node.js on private networks. On Linux, open the port in your firewall if one is running (`sudo ufw allow 8797/tcp`)."}]}
